The game refuses a lot of good spots with "AREA OBSTRUCTED" or "NO-BUILD ZONE", and a workbench that stands in the wrong place has to come down and go up again. This mod lets you build there and move a placed construction to a new spot. Each feature has its own switch, and each switch is on by default.

[size=4][b]Main features[/b][/size]
[list]
[*][b]Build over objects[/b]: place constructions over stumps, rocks, props, and ruins. Your own constructions, players, and animals still block, and the other build rules stay: ground, foundations, slopes, and resources.[/*]
[*][b]Build in no-build zones[/b]: place constructions where the game shows "NO-BUILD ZONE".[/*]
[*][b]Move mode[/b]: during build mode ([font=Courier New]B[/font]), press [font=Courier New]V[/font] to turn Move mode on. Workstations, storage, furniture, lamps, and decorations light up blue. Click one, then click a new spot to place it ([font=Courier New]R[/font] rotates). Walls, floors, foundations, and roofs do not move.[/*]
[/list]

A move follows the normal build rules, so a workbench still needs a foundation. The construction keeps its items, durability, fuel, and upgrades. An upgrade stays linked while it stands near its workstation, and a lit brazier takes its heat with it.

[size=4][b]Save safety[/b][/size]
The mod does not change the save format. A construction that you placed or moved with the mod is a normal construction in the save, so the save loads without the mod.

[size=4][b]Multiplayer[/b][/size]
Not tested in co-op. To build over objects or in no-build zones, the host and each player who builds need the mod: the host checks each placement again. Moving works for the host and in a solo game. For a player who joins a hosted game, a click in Move mode moves nothing.

[size=4][b]Requirements[/b][/size]
[list]
[*]Permafrost (Early Access), the update of 30 October 2026 or later.[/*]
[*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/permafrost/mods/42]UE4SS for Permafrost[/url], the UE4SS build that the mod is tested with.[/*]
[/list]

[size=4][b]Installation[/b][/size]
[list=1]
[*]Install [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/permafrost/mods/42]UE4SS for Permafrost[/url].[/*]
[*]Extract this mod's zip into the game folder (the folder with Permafrost.exe). The mod lands in Permafrost\Binaries\Win64\ue4ss\Mods. Full path example for Steam:
[code]C:\Program Files (x86)\Steam\steamapps\common\Permafrost\Permafrost\Binaries\Win64\ue4ss\Mods\BetterBuilding[/code][/*][/list]

[size=4][b]Uninstall[/b][/size]
Delete the [font=Courier New]BetterBuilding[/font] folder from the [font=Courier New]ue4ss\Mods[/font] folder.

[size=4][b]Configuration[/b][/size]
To change mod settings, edit [font=Courier New]ue4ss\Mods\BetterBuilding\config.lua[/font] while the game is closed (see [url=https://github.com/ivmakk-pf/pf-better-building/blob/main/CONFIG.md]CONFIG.md[/url] for every setting). Changes apply at the next game start.

